# The Transponder page, tabTransponder, with each control where the .resx puts it.
#
# Until the transponder has reported, every control but Connect to Transponder is disabled, as the
# .resx starts them. Five seconds after the screen starts, and every five after, the page looks for
# a UAVIONIX_ADSB_OUT_STATUS; with none ever had the button reads "Connect To Transponder", the
# C#'s own capital T. Connect sends MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL for that status once a second,
# waits for the answer, then three seconds for a status. SITL has no transponder and sends no
# status, so the page stays disabled and Connect ends in "Timeout: Status message not received.";
# what the buttons, the squawk and the flight ID send once a status has enabled them is held by
# the unit tests in crates/mp-gui/src/transponder.rs.
# `GCSViews/FlightData.cs:4314-4318, 6182-6482, GCSViews/FlightData.resx (tabTransponder)`
#
# Needs SITL (a copter): tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/fly-transponder.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen fly
window 1600x1200

# Within the first five seconds: the page as the .resx starts it.
expect fly.xpdr.connect Connect to Transponder
expect fly.xpdr.connect.enabled true
expect fly.xpdr.enabled false
expect fly.xpdr.squawk 1200
expect fly.xpdr.modes none
expect fly.xpdr.bold none
expect fly.xpdr.faults 0,0,0,0,0

# Brought to the front of the row, so its header is in view.
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
click fly-tabs-right
expect fly.tabs.first 6
click fly-tab-transponder
expect fly.tab tabTransponder
expect fly.page.overflow 0

# Past the first five seconds with the port open and no status.
settle 7
expect fly.xpdr.connect Connect To Transponder
expect fly.xpdr.connect.enabled true
expect fly.xpdr.enabled false

click fly-xpdr-connect
expect fly.sent COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL 10008,1000000,0,0,0,0,0
settle 5
expect status Timeout: Status message not received.
expect fly.xpdr.waiting no
expect fly.xpdr.enabled false

# Disabled, the mode buttons send nothing and nothing goes bold.
click fly-xpdr-on
expect fly.sent COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL 10008,1000000,0,0,0,0,0
expect fly.xpdr.bold none
expect fly.page.overflow 0
